# IONPI19: ion-pi interaction energies (cation-pi and anion-pi).
#
# S. Spicher, E. Caldeweyher, A. Hansen, S. Grimme,
# Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. 23 (2021) 11635-11648.
# https://doi.org/10.1039/D1CP01333E
#
# Contains: 17 association energies of ion-pi complexes plus 2 conformational
# energies (18 and 19, intramolecular ion-pi interactions). Geometries and
# reference data were taken from https://github.com/grimme-lab/benchmark-IONPI19
#
# Reference level: mixed, all high-level and counterpoise-corrected (see
# table 1 of the paper). Systems 1-3: CCSD(T)/CBS; 4-6: CCSD(T)/CBS with a
# modified frozen-core approximation; 7-8: W1-F12; 9-11: CCSD(T)/CBS;
# 12: W2-F12; 13-14 and 18-19: DLPNO-CCSD(T1)/CBS(aug-cc-pVTZ/aug-cc-pVQZ);
# 15-16: the same plus deformation energy; 17: DLPNO-CCSD(T1)/CBS(def2-TZVPP/
# def2-QZVPP) plus deformation energy. The authors estimate a mean error of
# 0.5 kcal/mol (2.2%), with the largest uncertainty in system 17 (1.9).
#
# Geometries: PBEh-3c for the systems compiled in this work (7, 8, and 12-19),
# with the conformers of 18 and 19 taken from a CREST/GFN2-xTB search. The
# rest are the geometries of the original references.
#
# Naming: NN_ab is the complex, NN_a the neutral (pi) fragment, and NN_b the
# ion. Reactions 18 and 19 are energy differences between two conformers of the
# same cation (NN_a minus NN_b). Reaction 16 reuses the calixarene monomer of
# reaction 15 (15_a).
#
# The systems are:
#   01  benzene + Li+                  11  guanine(6-ring) + Cl-
#   02  benzene + Na+                  12  C3N3F3 + Cl-
#   03  benzene + K+                   13  (C3N3F3)2 + Cl-
#   04  cytosine + Na+                 14  (C3N3F3)3 + Cl-
#   05  adenine(5-ring) + Li+          15  calixarene + NO3-
#   06  guanine(5-ring) + Na+          16  calixarene + SCN-
#   07  anthracene + C3H3+             17  cyclophane host-guest complex
#   08  C6F6 + Cl-                     18  ester, folded minus extended
#   09  thymine + Cl-                  19  seesaw, cation/pi minus pi/pi
#   10  adenine(6-ring) + Cl-
